    <!-- No <g:shipping> anywhere in this feed, on purpose. Shipping is $10 flat
         in the continental US and free over $150 (see /shipping), and that
         threshold cannot be expressed per item: nine hardcoded blocks got the
         rule wrong on every product except the one that clears $150 by itself.
         It lives in Merchant Center's account-level shipping settings instead.

         This is load-bearing. Item-level shipping OVERRIDES account settings,
         so putting a <g:shipping> block back on any item silently disables the
         free-over-$150 rule for that product. And shipping data is required in
         the US one way or the other — if the account-level rules are missing,
         every item here is disapproved for having no shipping at all. -->

